### 1. Minta Ambilkan Semua Produk (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

###

### 2. Minta Ambilkan Produk ID 1 (GET by ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

###

### 3. Kirim Bungkusan Produk Baru (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Susu Gula Aren",
  "price": 18000.0,
  "stock": 35
}

###

### 4. Ubah Data Produk ID 1 (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Gayo Arabika Premium (Diskon)",
  "price": 75000.0,
  "stock": 15
}

###

### 5. Minta Hapus Produk ID 2 (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/2

### 6. Uji Coba Satpam: Kirim Data Rusak (POST)
# Ekspektasi: Ditolak 400 Bad Request dengan rincian pesan error!
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -50000.0,
  "stock": -10
}

### 7. Uji Coba Pagination: Minta Halaman 0, Ukuran 1 Barang per Halaman
# Ekspektasi: Hanya muncul 1 barang, tapi ada info totalPages dan totalElements
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?page=0&size=1

###

### 8. Uji Coba Sorting: Urutkan Produk dari yang TERMAHAL ke Termurah (price,desc)
# Ekspektasi: Kopi Gayo (85000) muncul duluan sebelum Teh Walini (25000)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?sort=price,desc

### 3. Kirim Bungkusan Produk Baru (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Susu Gula Aren",
  "price": 18000.0,
  "stock": 35,
  "sellerId": 1
}

### 9. Uji Coba Pencarian: Cari Produk yang Ada Kata "Gayo" (?name=Gayo)
# Ekspektasi: Hanya Kopi Gayo yang muncul
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?name=Gayo

###

### 10. Uji Coba Filter Kategori: Cari Produk dengan Kategori "Minuman" (?category=Minuman)
# Ekspektasi: Kopi Gayo dan Teh Walini sama-sama muncul
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?category=Minuman

### ========================================================
### 4. TRANSAKSI MARKETPLACE (CHECKOUT KERANJANG BELANJA)
### ========================================================

### 11. Checkout Keranjang: Budi (buyerId=2) Beli 2 Kopi Gayo (ID 1)
# Ekspektasi: 201 Created, Total Rp 170.000, Stok Kopi Gayo dari 20 berkurang jadi 18!
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "buyerId": 2,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

###

### 12. Cek Stok Kopi Gayo Setelah Checkout: Pastikan Stok Berkurang!
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

###

### 13. Uji Coba Checkout Gagal: Beli Barang Melebihi Sisa Stok (Minta 500 Pcs!)
# Ekspektasi: Ditolak 400 Bad Request: "Stok tidak mencukupi..."
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "buyerId": 2,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 500
    }
  ]
}

###

### 14. Batalkan Pesanan (CANCELLED) & Uji Coba Auto-Restock
# Ekspektasi: Status jadi CANCELLED, dan stok barang otomatis dikembalikan ke toko!
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1/status?status=CANCELLED

### 1. Minta Ambilkan Semua Produk (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 3. Kirim Bungkusan Produk Baru (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Susu Gula Aren 1 Liter",
  "price": 65000.0,
  "stock": 15,
  "category": "Minuman",
  "sellerId": 1,
  "description": "Espresso blend dengan susu segar dan gula aren asli, botol 1 Liter tahan 5 hari di kulkas.",
  "imageUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517701550927-30cf4ba1dba5",
  "sku": "KOP-SUSU-1L",
  "weightGram": 1100
}

### 11. Checkout Keranjang: Budi Beli 2 Kopi Gayo Lengkap dengan Kurir & Alamat
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "buyerId": 2,
  "shippingCourier": "JNE Reguler",
  "shippingCost": 18000.0,
  "paymentMethod": "BCA_VA",
  "shippingAddress": "Jl. Sudirman Kav. 25, RT 01/RW 02, Jakarta Selatan",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 12. Cek Stok & Total Terjual Kopi Gayo
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### 15. Penjual Mengirim Pesanan (Status: SHIPPED)
# Ekspektasi: Muncul nomor resi pelacakan otomatis (RESI-JNE-...)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1/status?status=SHIPPED

### ========================================================
### 5. SISTEM KEAMANAN & AUTENTIKASI (SPRING SECURITY + JWT)
### ========================================================

### 16. Login sebagai Toko Kopi (Role: SELLER)
# Ekspektasi: 200 OK dan mendapatkan Token JWT dengan role SELLER!
# @name loginSeller
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kopinusantara@mail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 17. Login sebagai Budi Santoso (Role: BUYER)
# Ekspektasi: 200 OK dan mendapatkan Token JWT dengan role BUYER!
# @name loginBuyer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "budi@mail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 18. Uji Coba Satpam: Coba Tambah Produk TANPA Login / Tiket JWT
# Ekspektasi: Ditolak Satpam 403 Forbidden!
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Ilegal Tanpa Login",
  "price": 50000.0,
  "stock": 10,
  "category": "Minuman",
  "sellerId": 1
}

###

### 19. Uji Coba RBAC (Hak Akses): Budi (BUYER) Nekat Mau Tambah Produk Toko!
# Ekspektasi: Ditolak 403 Forbidden karena tiket Budi bertuliskan BUYER, bukan SELLER!
# Ganti <TOKEN_BUDI> dengan token dari response Login Budi (Request 17)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJrb3BpbnVzYW50YXJhQG1haWwuY29tIiwidXNlcklkIjoxLCJyb2xlIjoiU0VMTEVSIiwiaWF0IjoxNzk0OTAxOTM4LCJleHAiOjE3OTQ5ODgzMzh9.XRXB8reoP3ZS8RfVNk24kGoGPWD--BMDrwsjvAR9uhJJO9ApIY_Sk3C0CB-3Bt6t
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Bajakan Milik Buyer",
  "price": 20000.0,
  "stock": 5,
  "category": "Minuman",
  "sellerId": 1
}

###

### 20. Penjual Resmi (SELLER) Tambah Produk dengan Token Sah
# Ekspektasi: 201 Created! Berhasil lolos satpam!
# Ganti <TOKEN_SELLER> dengan token dari response Login Toko Kopi (Request 16)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJrb3BpbnVzYW50YXJhQG1haWwuY29tIiwidXNlcklkIjoxLCJyb2xlIjoiU0VMTEVSIiwiaWF0IjoxNzk0OTAxOTM4LCJleHAiOjE3OTQ5ODgzMzh9.XRXB8reoP3ZS8RfVNk24kGoGPWD--BMDrwsjvAR9uhJJO9ApIY_Sk3C0CB-3Bt6t
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Arabika Mandailing 250g",
  "price": 90000.0,
  "stock": 25,
  "category": "Minuman",
  "sellerId": 1,
  "description": "Kopi Arabika Mandailing dengan rasa earthy khas Sumatera.",
  "sku": "KOP-MAND-250G",
  "weightGram": 250
}